# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Git exclusion rules for the Aurelia Bank CRM MCP Server application.
# Architecture/Context: Prevents credentials, virtual environments, and local
#   SQLite database artifacts inside `mcp_server/` from being committed to VCS.
# Dependencies/Side Effects: Consumed by Git CLI and container build contexts.
# Author: Pradeep Singh
# License: Apache-2.0
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Secrets & Credential Protection
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
secrets/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Build, Runtime & Dependency Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
venv/
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# SQLite Runtime Databases & WAL Files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. OS & IDE Noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
